Keeper: A Distributed Coordination Service for Distributed Applications","ZOOKEEPER-5118 - Update vulnerable website dependencies: @vitest/mocker, vite, zod, happy-dom, source-map-js","ZOOKEEPER-5116 - GitHub Action website and CI build fails on master","ZOOKEEPER-5109 - SERVER\\_JVMFLAGS was passed to diagnostic client commands","ZOOKEEPER-5108 - Client SASL settings set to \"true\" with trailing whitespace are read as false","ZOOKEEPER-5103 - Address multiple memory leaks identified by static analysis","ZOOKEEPER-5100 - Fix ZooKeeper website build failure","ZOOKEEPER-5099 - Upgrade jackson jars to 2.22.3 or latest to address CVE-2026-91776, CVE-2026-91777","ZOOKEEPER-5098 - Upgrade netty to 4.1.138 or latest to fix CVE-2026-89044","ZOOKEEPER-5097 - Make DataTree snapshot serialization iterative","ZOOKEEPER-5093 - Possible io resource leak in FileTxnSnapLog.close","ZOOKEEPER-5091 - WatchManager reports connections with no active watches after consuming the last standard watch","ZOOKEEPER-5087 - Suppress false positive OpenTelemetry CVE-s in OWASP dependency check","ZOOKEEPER-5086 - Upgrade Netty to 4.1.137.Final","ZOOKEEPER-5083 - Upgrade Jackson-databind to 2.22.2 to fix known security vulnerabilities","ZOOKEEPER-5082 - Remove special characters from audit logs","ZOOKEEPER-5081 - Exclude zookeeper-website from OWASP Dependency-Check","ZOOKEEPER-5080 - Flaky test: SnapshotAndRestoreCommandTest.testSnapshotAndRestoreCommand\\_streaming","ZOOKEEPER-5077 - Upgrade Netty to 4.1.136.Final","ZOOKEEPER-5076 - Upgrade to JDK 17 in Owasp Jenkinsfile","ZOOKEEPER-5075 - Upgrade jline jar to 3.30.14 or higher to fix CVE-2026-56740","ZOOKEEPER-5067 - Remove older docs picker from the docs page","ZOOKEEPER-5066 - Update JDK11 to JDK 17, 25 in s390x jenkinsfile","ZOOKEEPER-5065 - Preserve doap.rdf in website builds","ZOOKEEPER-5061 - ZooKeeper website fixes","ZOOKEEPER-5060 - Update GitHub Actions versions","ZOOKEEPER-5059 - Kerberos SASL leaks Login refresh threads across Quorum